## Red work

I added `controlled-imports-phase2-review-b.red.test.ts` for the five blocking
Review B findings. The tests use injected Company Identity and private-evidence
preparation fakes. They do not use live CRM, Tutor, database, storage, or
provider adapters.

The tests cover fabricated and foreign evidence, company and school scope
binding, malformed authorization decisions, caller-built and mutated plans,
unknown nested fields and kinds, ambiguity-group counterexamples, duplicate
payroll voucher identities, and the blocked pilot contract.

